S|Quick note on the Brightwater account. They renewed for one year at the current price.
D|Good news. Did they ask for anything new?
S|Only a quarterly business review. I said yes, starting in February.
D|Fine. I will add it to the account plan and set a reminder for the first review.
S|Also, their invoice contact changed. The new contact is in the shared folder.
D|Got it. I will update the billing system today.
D|One more thing. Their support tickets dropped by a third since the last release.
S|Let's mention that in the review. It's a good story for the renewal next year.
D|Agreed. I will pull the ticket numbers for the last two quarters.
D|Should we offer them the new reporting add on at the review?
S|Yes, but only as a trial for three months, so there is no pressure on the budget.
S|Thanks. That's everything for Brightwater.
